* Ethereum system contracts
** System call
*** Caller 0xff...fe, value 0, 30M gas
*** Not counted in block gas
*** Unchecked: 4788, 2935
*** Checked: 7002, 7251, failure invalidates block
** Ring buffers
*** EIP-4788 beacon roots, keyed by timestamp
*** EIP-2935 block hashes, keyed by number
*** 8191 entries, about 27 hours
** Request queues
*** EIP-7002 withdrawals, 56-byte input
*** EIP-7251 consolidations, 96-byte input
*** Fee: fake exponential of excess
*** Overpayment is not refunded
*** EIP-7685 requests_hash to the CL
left side
** Deposit contract
*** Solidity 0.6.11, not a system contract
*** EIP-6110 scans DepositEvent logs
*** CL verifies the BLS signature later
** In development (Amsterdam, unscheduled)
*** EIP-8282 builder queues
**** Spec says permanently disabled
**** Code re-enables without input
*** EIP-7997 CREATE2 factory
*** EIP-8272 recent roots, Draft
** Integrator checks
*** CALLER must match the credentials
*** Read the fee, cap it, pay exactly
*** Queued does not mean accepted
*** Empty account returns success
*** 4788 code hash: use the deployed 97 bytes
